--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset Attribution (SendWise_Dataset.csv):

The training dataset in model_training/data/ was collected in 2025 from public
YouTube comments and X (Twitter) posts under the Fair Use / Research Exemption
for academic study. Text records were annotated by five independent annotators
and cross-verified. No personally identifiable information, user handles, or
private messages are included. Redistribution of this dataset is permitted
under CC-BY 4.0 with attribution to the SendWise paper (Gaikwad & Ohatkar, 2026).
